stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: INSERT in the business transaction
  PENDING --> PROCESSING: claim() CAS UPDATE, attempts+1, lease 60 s
  PROCESSING --> SENT: publish ok (broker confirm)
  PROCESSING --> PENDING: publish failed, backoff 2s * 2^(n-1), cap 300 s
  PROCESSING --> PROCESSING: lease expired, another relay re-claims (crashed relay)
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: attempts >= 8 or unreadable payload
  SENT --> [*]: purged after 7 days
